<title>HONG KONG: Citibank issues call warrants on red-chip basket.</title>
<headline>Citibank issues call warrants on red-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, N.A., Hong Kong Branch said on Tuesday it has issued 300 million American style call warrants on shares of a basket of six red-chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				  0.1   shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Beijing Land Ltd	     0.35  shrs</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd			  0.1   shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd		 0.025 shrs</p>
<p> China Travel Int'l Investment Hong Kong Ltd 0.1   shrs</p>
<p> China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd     0.02  shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.7134	    PREMIUM	  14.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1854	    GEARING	  4.02X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD   1 YR FROM LISTING  MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	    LISTING DATE   05.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$7.4593</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
